                                "sense_id": "c055aae6-6eeb-3e0a-9c5e-5654c2576db8",
                                "text": "The dealers in live Gilas were paying local trappers twenty-five to fifty cents an inch; in turn the lizards were being sold to out-of-state dealers at one to two dollars an inch."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5eec7d92-6c4d-3aa8-af5c-b2f54e5c49f1",
