                                "sense_id": "5eec7d92-6c4d-3aa8-af5c-b2f54e5c49f1",
                                "text": "In addition, area streams containing Gilas provide potential for far more fishing than any brown trout water — first, because the Gilas ..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4758d025-5d44-4145-ad66-acad89d0be68",
                                "sense_id": "5eec7d92-6c4d-3aa8-af5c-b2f54e5c49f1",
                                "text": "There were trout, they were small, and they were not Gilas."
